    "detailed_description": "Welcome in this unique puzzle-casual game of Tanks Boom Boom. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nSet aside! The Mega-Tank is coming, destroying everything in front of him. Our advice is to join the tank cabin,using all it\u2019s skills like : speed booster,time warp,money booster,otherwise you risk being eaten alive. Convince yourself right now that either you win or you are bound to lose. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour mission is to pass every level shooting the cubes so that mathematically it comes out at 0. Fire in the hole !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features :<br />\r\n- More than 60 levels<br />\r\n- A series of bonus levels<br />\r\n- Use the special skills of the tank : speed booster, reload speed, money booster",
